{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blast through the stars in this high-octane platformer-shooter!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the space suit of a fearless astronaut on a mission to stop an alien invasion threatening the galaxy. <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> combines fast-paced action, tight platforming, and explosive shootouts across a variety of dynamic arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless-wave combat zones</strong> teeming with alien enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive boss battles</strong> that push your skills to the limit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon evolves automatically as you progress \u2014 unlocking <strong>three power stages</strong> that unleash devastating firepower just when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're dodging lasers, leaping over alien-infested gaps, or holding the line against impossible odds, <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong> delivers an adrenaline-pumping experience that keeps you coming back for one more run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 2D platformer shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold sci-fi pixel art style and energetic soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the storm. Save the galaxy.</strong><br>Are you ready for the <strong>Cosmic Tempest</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688310?t=1767086215","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688310?t=1767086215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688310/43b2e1f95ec5dc7a0c25a8b17964090498ca14be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767086215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.ak